QUERY NAME: TotalTests_Project
---------------------------------------------
TYPE: SELECT

SQL:
SELECT tlkpTestReqmt_MAP.Buyer, Sum(tlkpTestReqmt_MAP.NoRequired) AS SumOfNoRequired, Sum([Norequired]*[UnitPrice]) AS Cost, tlkpTestReqmt_MAP.TestCode
FROM tlkpTestReqmt_MAP
GROUP BY tlkpTestReqmt_MAP.Buyer, tlkpTestReqmt_MAP.TestCode
WITH OWNERACCESS OPTION;

